          "text": "Témoignages: [D16] de MAGESCQ (40) vers DAX (40) 22.02.2022",
          "text_sha256": "5d16d268b65d684eea096c0a7de49671bf7a32b3621a216bf2272b514210b68f"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
